    "referenceSolution": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <set>\n#include <map>\n#include <queue>\n#include <deque>\n#include <stack>\n#include <numeric>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <climits>\n#include <utility>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){int n,q;cin>>n>>q;vector<long long>a(n);for(auto&x:a)cin>>x;sort(a.begin(),a.end());for(int i=0;i<q;i++){long long x,best;cin>>x;auto it=lower_bound(a.begin(),a.end(),x);if(it==a.end())best=a.back();else if(it==a.begin())best=*it;else{long long l=*(it-1),r=*it;best=x-l<=r-x?l:r;}if(i)cout<<' ';cout<<best;}cout<<'\\n';}\n",
